t distributing to OpenCode. The `.opencode/` directory is the OpenCode side of arc (agents + commands + skills). Let me check if there's a .gitignore inside that ignores some of it, and see its full layout.\n\nLet me check what .opencode/.gitignore contains and the full tree listing including dirs.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1340a3e9f001ydLqr4Ynh74zev","sessionID":"ses_ecbf849dcffe1ywd0dEC0OOYDy","messageID":"msg_13409f601001iiGSzQyX13QX14"}}
